WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:04.770
- Why am I even trying to be a nurse? I'm gonna be delivering pizzas and cleaning carpets for the rest of my life.

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.770
NO!

00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:15.330
- You're very attractive for a carpet cleaning lady, although you maybe could do something with your hair, you know?

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:18.510
No, that's not it. It's your face. Yeah.

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:22.600
Could you be a doll and get me a little smack?

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:25.040
- You know I was just hired to do carpets, right?

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:25.769
- You're fired.

00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:28.590
- I bet you haven't worked a single day in your entire

00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:31.560
self-absorbed life. Just pay me and I'll be on my way.

00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:32.160
- Nope.

00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:34.160
 

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:35.469
- No, no! My equipment!

00:00:35.469 --> 00:00:36.480
- He is the devil.

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:38.849
- I owe the cleaning company 3000 bucks for a new machine,

00:00:38.860 --> 00:00:41.999
and they fired me. Rich people can get away with everything.

00:00:41.999 --> 00:00:42.920
 

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:43.999
- Help!

00:00:43.999 --> 00:00:45.999
(splash)

00:00:46.390 --> 00:00:49.820
- I don't know what day it is. I don't even know my own name.

00:00:49.820 --> 00:00:51.750
- Amnesia in our little town.

00:00:52.149 --> 00:00:53.300
- That's him.

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:55.859
- I have an idea that is poetic in its justice.

00:00:56.860 --> 00:00:58.780
- I'm here to pick up my husband.

00:00:58.780 --> 00:01:00.160
- You're really my wife?

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:01.649
- For better or worse, baby.

00:01:01.649 --> 00:01:03.649
 

00:01:03.649 --> 00:01:05.080
- I'm poor?

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:05.800
- Yep.

00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:06.880
- Daddy!

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:08.280
- How come they don't look like me?

00:01:08.280 --> 00:01:09.629
- We had to use a sperm donor.

00:01:09.629 --> 00:01:11.629
- I'm sterile?

00:01:12.220 --> 00:01:15.000
- You're getting picked up for work bright and early. (horn honks)

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:17.960
- I work? Three jobs.

00:01:17.960 --> 00:01:19.970
Aw, I want a fake husband.

00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:21.970
(mocking noises)

00:01:21.970 --> 00:01:23.970
 

00:01:23.970 --> 00:01:25.970
 

00:01:25.970 --> 00:01:27.970
(laughter)

00:01:27.970 --> 00:01:29.970
 

00:01:29.970 --> 00:01:31.970
 

00:01:31.970 --> 00:01:33.970
- Hi, honey! How was your first day?

00:01:33.970 --> 00:01:35.970
- (mumbling)

00:01:37.140 --> 00:01:38.920
- Do we need to take him to the hospital?

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:41.000
- I said Bobby.

